  <tr><td>Medical Board age band</td><td>Relevant where it straddles or exceeds 18</td><td>Fallback proof, subordinate to school and birth records</td></tr>
  <tr><td>School / matriculation records</td><td>Often unavailable at this stage</td><td>The first rung of the statutory hierarchy</td></tr>
