</table>
<div class="note">Bail orders in POCSO matters decide custody pending trial and nothing more; the charges, the age determination and the truth of the rival narratives remain for the Special Court. The identity of victims in such cases is protected by law, and this article reproduces only what the Court&rsquo;s published order records.</div>
